<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on the DAX index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on the DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG said it has issued 120 million American-style call and put warrants, in 12 equal tranches, on the DAX index.</p>
<p>Eight tranches expire on August 15, 1997 and four tranches expire on January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>There will be listing in Frankfurt and Dusseldorf and there is a minimum exercise of 100 warrants.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
